<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>apps - hannesnagel</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <style>
        .apps-head {
            width: 100%;
            text-align: left;
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .apps-grid {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .app-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 300px) 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #fff;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.25s var(--spring), box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
        }

        .app-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            border-color: #b3a890;
        }

        /* whole card opens the details page; inner links stay clickable above */
        .card-link {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .card-link::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card-link:focus-visible::after {
            outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
            outline-offset: -3px;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .app-card .badge-list {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .app-media {
            background: #10141b;
            padding: 0.6rem;
            border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .app-media.light {
            background: #f6f1e6;
        }

        .app-media img {
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .app-body {
            padding: 1rem;
            display: grid;
            align-content: start;
            gap: 0.7rem;
        }

        .app-body p {
            max-width: none;
        }

        .badge-list {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .app-store-badge {
            height: 40px;
        }

        .chip-link {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            color: var(--ink);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: #fff;
        }

        .small-grid {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 0.9rem;
        }

        .small-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.7rem;
            justify-items: start;
            position: relative;
            transition: transform 0.25s var(--spring), box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
        }

        .small-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            border-color: #b3a890;
        }

        .small-card .chip-link::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
        }

        .small-card img {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .app-media.pod-art {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2a1d4d, #14102b);
        }

        .pod-eq {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 6px;
            height: 46%;
            width: 62%;
        }

        .pod-eq i {
            flex: 1;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #a78bfa, #6d3fc4);
            transform-origin: bottom;
            animation: pod-eq 0.9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
            height: var(--h);
            animation-delay: var(--dl);
        }

        @keyframes pod-eq {
            from { transform: scaleY(0.3); }
            to { transform: scaleY(1); }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .pod-eq i {
                animation: none;
                transform: scaleY(0.7);
            }
        }

        .wip-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            border: 1px solid #6d3fc4;
            color: #6d3fc4;
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        @media (max-width: 880px) {
            .app-card {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .app-media {
                border-right: 0;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            }

            .small-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section>
            <div class="apps-head reveal">
                <p class="sub-header">Apps</p>
                <h1>Things I have built and keep improving.</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="apps-grid reveal">
                <article class="app-card">
                    <div class="app-media pod-art" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="pod-eq">
                            <i style="--h:55%;--dl:0s"></i><i style="--h:85%;--dl:-.2s"></i><i style="--h:65%;--dl:-.5s"></i><i style="--h:100%;--dl:-.3s"></i><i style="--h:75%;--dl:-.7s"></i><i style="--h:90%;--dl:-.1s"></i><i style="--h:60%;--dl:-.4s"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-body">
                        <span class="wip-chip">● In development</span>
                        <h2><a class="card-link" href="/podcatcher/">The Podcatcher</a></h2>
                        <p>The podcast app I am building right now: iCloud sync, iPhone + iPad + Mac, up to 5× speed, transcripts, automatic AI chapters, and chapter skip rules.</p>
                        <div class="badge-list">
                            <a href="/podcatcher/" class="chip-link">Open details</a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="chip-link">Get notified</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="app-card">
                    <div class="app-media light">
                        <img src="/images/i-told-you-so_receipt.png?v=2" alt="I Told You So">
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-body">
                        <h2><a class="card-link" href="/i-told-you-so/">I Told You So</a></h2>
                        <p>Record predictions and friendly bets, settle them later, and share a clean receipt.</p>
                        <div class="badge-list">
                            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6763559466">
                                <img src="https://tools.applemediaservices.com/api/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?size=250x83" alt="Download on the App Store" class="app-store-badge">
                            </a>
                            <a href="/i-told-you-so/" class="chip-link">Open details</a>
                            <a href="/i-told-you-so/privacy" class="chip-link">Privacy</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="app-card">
                    <div class="app-media">
                        <img src="/images/containeye_promo.png" alt="ContainEye">
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-body">
                        <h2><a class="card-link" href="/containeye/">ContainEye</a></h2>
                        <p>Monitor servers and Docker containers from iPhone. Includes SSH terminal, checks, and shortcuts support.</p>
                        <div class="badge-list">
                            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/containeye-terminal-docker/id6741063706">
                                <img src="https://tools.applemediaservices.com/api/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?size=250x83" alt="Download on the App Store" class="app-store-badge">
                            </a>
                            <a href="/containeye/" class="chip-link">Open details</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="app-card">
                    <div class="app-media">
                        <img src="/images/recipes_promo.png" alt="Recipes">
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-body">
                        <h2><a class="card-link" href="/recipes/">The Recipes App</a></h2>
                        <p>Recipe collection with shopping list support and web access.</p>
                        <div class="badge-list">
                            <a href="https://apps.apple.com/de/app/the-recipes-app/id6745904570">
                                <img src="https://tools.applemediaservices.com/api/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?size=250x83" alt="Download on the App Store" class="app-store-badge">
                            </a>
                            <a href="https://recipes.hannesnagel.com" class="chip-link">Web app</a>
                            <a href="/recipes/" class="chip-link">Open details</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <article class="app-card">
                    <div class="app-media">
                        <img src="/images/superghost_promo.png" alt="Superghost">
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-body">
                        <h2><a class="card-link" href="/ghost/">Ghost / Superghost</a></h2>
                        <p>A multiplayer word game. Open source backend in Swift and Vapor.</p>
                        <div class="badge-list">
                            <a href="https://github.com/hannesmnagel/superghost" class="chip-link">Source code</a>
                            <a href="/ghost/" class="chip-link">Open details</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="apps-head reveal">
                <p class="sub-header">Earlier Projects</p>
                <h2>Still part of my path.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="small-grid reveal">
                <article class="small-card">
                    <img src="/images/zettl" alt="Zettl">
                    <h3>Zettl</h3>
                    <p>Time tracking app work during my time at codeunity.</p>
                    <a href="https://zettl.app" class="chip-link">zettl.app</a>
                </article>
                <article class="small-card">
                    <img src="/images/ear2brain" alt="ear2brain">
                    <h3>ear2brain</h3>
                    <p>My first released app. Vocabulary learning project.</p>
                    <a href="https://ear2brain.app" class="chip-link">ear2brain.app</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
